    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c24c68b1b4834822605e0145",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，你能帮我吗？\n我、无论如何……无论如何……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f89542c29bf88d646f2f5a21b1211d05bc8351b0551580704d53d94a27b0aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:410c565ca32c91ef26c1340c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来时机已到。\n是时候让曼城茶座登上舞台了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "430ec36e73e58e61ec26fd1a47a39a2c193746ecbab0102bc35937965384c3a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26a280d8e08a60097cb92dd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若她能站上系列赛的顶点并追上“朋友”，\n或许就能获得她最向往的幸福也不一定。\n于是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "218d44abe547106277c7aa6b4b1afb09c8b111bb73d275f22b6b3ddcd5cce270",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acc553c8472a174fff8c2ca5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00a6bf8904b99f1ffbf26574",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，还真是凑巧。\n这不是咖啡和她的训练员嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39471c7dbb80b516710ed41bba8b0ca7d4e63ac8f50e88ddc14042ab0608bead",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:531f9b425a855de5d5e3dd98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "曼城茶座",
      "source_fingerprint": "d954d0142b37975f0fc4d92f09ba75f9d3a0fd440959bda37bcf818148a467be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e8b69308753c4acc355d17d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……？你是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfde70bb86d7b035da448e440431a013153250a283e31308d837d18d4e1ae961",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daa46758edad6b7ad718c555",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "曼城茶座",
      "source_fingerprint": "d954d0142b37975f0fc4d92f09ba75f9d3a0fd440959bda37bcf818148a467be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62f64bc2b840411ae3610998",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我从没看过她的长相，\n因为她总是跑在我前面。\n无论我怎么努力追，都追不上……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6c4bf8eccd5c70a8b89540e7cc66126321ec1c50da35a4446292b2a53d1b92a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7757cf5c0cc59a99cd34282b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "和我们搭话的人是爱丽速子。\n她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "368498f76d77e923e53c0a4c913dbc5e21e2a9453a77e3bc01b62d0bc6e0a3f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:165733e0c33b2b987e6bdd4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是特雷森学园里出名的赛马娘研究家，\n也是为了探究可能性\n愿意付出一切的疯狂科学家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71fedf663f589a77d2926e8a657f831ff94e605120b275d268576fea45621c76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a184b37fc756bbc21f18827",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这间研究室──\n则是她和曼城茶座共用的空教室。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e347d4f851b6ff2ebf08bf639ef2bef7e96a9d1f6801d0ec32eacfecd37ae8b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5f513e50a2f65c2140247cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这间教室最初是学生会\n借给曼城茶座，\n让她用来摆放大量爱好品的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "590209f2d8037a52b79e76e3a29bd8483bb56a0eaac1ef1252973672ed885d3c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5405871aa07aa83e07bdce74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那之后，爱丽速子向学生会要求\n要有一间“研究室”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "72d5a26278b36b2d4e5c04fad88c8a8c733b0d701e062304a64438631274bfd5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f1e724b4aa7dc0f11a3835c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "学生会判断“让问题儿童\n独自拥有一间教室过于危险。\n但如果有人监督的话可以妥协”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff5b8319ccf55df5969bbbc83ceeeb581fe0d10de922bae3408cb1a990144d52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85f1954a09dd65442ad33f0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是这间教室的一半，\n便成为了爱丽速子的研究室──",
      "source_fingerprint": "063fc5dcbfa54ccaa7368debb27e032d99a0f9d12d62ed1735390f733adcc35b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:854286f95b5f11a3b66b005b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一半则继续作为\n曼城茶座的收集品仓库──\n并同时赋予她监督的责任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc5e009c9d7380d957ff405722cbdd56a6b383b078b49fe95929808c7b83e0dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f8bf1f0a72abead66757ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "曼城茶座",
      "source_fingerprint": "d954d0142b37975f0fc4d92f09ba75f9d3a0fd440959bda37bcf818148a467be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
