      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62cfcfb98d4f640b9d74fd7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e782616fdaceeba856a92d12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈，不要这么见外嘛！\n我们不是臭味相投的好搭档吗？对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1ff49232766eafe8475f91a9505706f6e50864c156af394c1b9bc2a7546382a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:765079fbea1119e0aa926d86",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "曼城茶座",
      "source_fingerprint": "d954d0142b37975f0fc4d92f09ba75f9d3a0fd440959bda37bcf818148a467be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:502c49420451badda4b9afbe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们总是会跟彼此说话。\n但有一件事情……我却迟迟没能开口问她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c85130c705fcd7651aa07d4b30bba93db5edc98a4deb69379fdc65a47727739",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f85d05a6d77809c562b39aa4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:564548b3ea40f9b321e0a87a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "茶座，你的目的是追着\n无人能看见的假想朋友。\n──原来如此，一般人确实难以理解。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81db3db9e7812795f2b089337e23416217ebbd12606779a91843d80cb690176d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b95b0969b4cb56512058e86",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26bfcb59a0890029cc6fb77b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我呢，追求的则是赛马娘的极限……\n更要超越极限。而不止步于胜利而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df351218090c4d287df5603196be51944e9f31f14e94c49cfa4c49ee7b6b610d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dde9fc17e68f26cf7da5c2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
